--- task
id: t38
dataset: section8
kind: the engine catalogue

--- intent
List the name and inputs of every physical operator the engine has.

--- edition2
query operators() {
  match { $o: @Operator }
  return { $o.name, $o.inputs }
}

--- edition3
query operators() {
  match { $o: @Operator }
  return { $o.name, $o.inputs }
}

--- expect unordered live

--- note
The rows are the engine's operator catalogue, which changes with the engine, so they are compared live against the ground truth's rows instead of being recorded.
